1
00:00:00,039 --> 00:00:02,999
(Howard:)...prepare for shock and awe.

2
00:00:03,334 --> 00:00:06,254
You know, I am ending this.
Penny didn't wanna hold the ring.

3
00:00:06,421 --> 00:00:09,301
(Leonard:)She gave it to me. I have it.
I'm sending it back.

4
00:00:09,716 --> 00:00:13,346
(Leonard:)-Where's the ring?
-You mean this ring?

5
00:00:14,762 --> 00:00:18,472
(Sheldon:)Be aware of your surroundings
while urinating in a public men's room.

6
00:00:18,891 --> 00:00:20,731
(Leonard:)-Give me that.
-No, it's mine.

7
00:00:20,893 --> 00:00:22,023
(Raj:)It's all of ours.

8
00:00:22,186 --> 00:00:23,226
[ALL GRUNTING]

9
00:00:23,396 --> 00:00:24,896
Okay, this is ridiculous.

10
00:00:25,064 --> 00:00:26,984
(Howard:)-Then let go!
-I'm not. You let go.

11
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:30,610
(Howard:)I say this ring belongs to the last person
who can hold on.

12
00:00:31,028 --> 00:00:32,738
Fine. Can't we go home and start?

13
00:00:32,905 --> 00:00:35,285
(Raj:)Sure. Let go of the ring.

14
00:00:36,242 --> 00:00:37,702
(Leonard:)All right. It starts now.

15
00:00:42,540 --> 00:01:01,020
You do realize there's a giant-bug movie
marathon tonight on the Syfy Channel.

